{"channelId":"UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","row":["Dog Rescue Station",2730,"Welcome to Dog Rescue Station — a channel dedicated to the emotional rescue journeys of abandoned and homeless dogs, brought to life through powerful AI driven storytelling.\n\nWe recreate authentic rescue scenarios inspired by real life events — from puppies left alone in freezing rain, injured strays struggling to survive, to loyal dogs abandoned in their old age.\n\nThe heartbreaking reality faced by abandoned dogs.\nLife changing encounters that rebuild trust between dogs and humans.\nMoments where compassion, patience, and care bring a broken dog back to life.\n\nOur mission is to raise awareness about responsible dog ownership and promote the message adopt, don’t abandon. We believe that even a small act of kindness can completely change the destiny of a helpless dog.\n\nBehind the scenes, our dedicated team transforms real rescue stories into deeply emotional and visually immersive experiences. Let Dog Rescue Station take you to the moments where love, compassion, and action save a life.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:50.471Z","channelId":"UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5d0279533c314036ef3878c572a83f88d8fb28c45f913ae463cf8058724f2a72","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"70cd8bd82660bf097db9753cb29e8f14a89e690283d7144b02dadb2a04e07e80"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:50.471Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2730,"raw":"2.73K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqPDTHN_vc2zXGKEUTm-Ssw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12